  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To equip farmers to become self-sustaining and profitable using Pfumvudza concept signature and enable livelihood transformation of small-scale farmers to ensure self-sufficiency.  To use sustainable agricultural practices to break poverty by training and 
mentoring and create a profitable model for small scale farming in Zimbabwe.</narrative>
